{
  "_note": "首页:关注的服务各自的总体状态 + 进行中事故,原样交给页面 JS 归一(状态档 / 事故挑选 / 时长全在 JS 里算,与组件的 follow.df 同一套判据:状态档 = max(总体指示灯, 进行中事故影响),取不到 = 未知)。\n首屏缓存做在页面 JS 层(flowCached:存的是归一后的精简模型,不是这份原始响应 —— incident.io 那几家的 incidents.json 30–40KB,整份落盘不划算),所以本流豁免 data 层缓存。",
  "_lintCache": "exempt",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "idsIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ids},)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删):页面把关注列表按 ~ 拼好传进来。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "flk",
        "value": "~${idsIn}~"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(contains::(${flk},~github~),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "st_github",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/api/v2/status.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ur_github",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/api/v2/incidents/unresolved.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
